==Battleground==
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.33~2 seconds<sup>40f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**40 [[Snache]]s (100%) spawn, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Kyuubei]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

